+### User transfer (between organizations)
+
+`POST /orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}/transfer` with `{"toOrgId":"globex"}` moves a
+user from `{orgID}` to another organization (for example between group
+companies). It is all or nothing.
+
+- Malformed body or missing `toOrgId` → 400, before any of the rules below.
+- Unknown or missing user → 401. Caller not in `{orgID}` → 404.
+- Only an org admin of `{orgID}` may transfer → otherwise 403.
+- `{uid}` unknown, or not a user of `{orgID}` → 404.
+- `toOrgId` unknown (no user or project belongs to it) → 400. `toOrgId` equal to
+  `{orgID}` → 400.
+- On success the user's org changes and their org admin flag is cleared. Their
+  memberships in projects outside the new organization are removed, and tasks
+  assigned to them in such projects are unassigned, so the model rules still
+  hold. Response: 200 `{"id","orgId"}`.
+
